  "descriptions": {
    "aws-ecr": "Priced from the AWS Price List for image storage in eu-west-1; the estate does not report repository sizes, so ECR components stay unpriced.",
    "aws-firehose": "Priced from the AWS Price List per GB ingested (tier 1, batch); the estate does not report Firehose volume, so Firehose components stay unpriced.",
    "aws-sns": "Priced from the AWS Price List for API requests after the first million; the free tier and delivery attempts to HTTP/SQS are not modelled.",
    "managed-pg-branching": "Priced from Neon's Scale plan: CU-hours, storage and public transfer; see x_price_sources. Tiers are priced running all month (730 h); scale to zero costs less. 1 CU = 4 GB RAM per Neon's plans page; 1 vCPU per CU is the skeleton's assumption. Features are the skeleton's and were not checked against Neon's extension list.",
    "managed-pg-platform": "Priced from Supabase's dedicated compute sizes (Large to 8XL), its disk price and its Pro egress price; see x_price_sources. The Pro plan's monthly base fee is not included. Features are the skeleton's and were not checked against Supabase's extension list.",
    "managed-pg-serverless": "Priced from Neon's Launch plan: CU-hours, storage and public transfer; see x_price_sources. Tiers are priced running all month (730 h); scale to zero costs less. 1 CU = 4 GB RAM per Neon's plans page; 1 vCPU per CU is the skeleton's assumption. Features are the skeleton's and were not checked against Neon's extension list."
  }
